     <p style="text-align:center"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 24px">2025年绍兴一中教育集团高一新生军训方案</span></strong></p><p><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:14px"> </span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">一、指导思想</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:宋体">为贯彻落实《教育部、中央军委国防动员部关于印发</span><span style="font-family:Calibri"><</span><span style="font-family:宋体">高中阶段学校学生军事训练教学 大纲</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">></span><span style="font-family:宋体">》的精神，为了增强高一新生的国防意识，磨练学生的意志，让学生接触军营，了解军人，体验部队训练和生活，培养学生爱国主义、集体主义精神，激发学生积极向上、奋发进取的热情，从而使学生具有严明的组织纪律性，养成良好的学习、生活、卫生习惯。学校决定对高一新生进行为期七天的军训，特制定本方案。</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">二、训练内容</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">1</span><span style="font-family:宋体">．基本军事知识学习：人民军队、现代国防、军兵种知识。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:宋体">．基本军事技能训练：单兵队列动作、队列队形训练、军语标准化、分列式。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">3</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">．急救技能培训、消防灭火培训、紧急逃生演练。</span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">4</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">．军旅文化学习：内务整理、仪容仪表、国防教育。</span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">5</span></span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">．合唱表演：合唱比赛。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">三、组织领导</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:宋体"></span>组  长：蒋明<span style="font-family:宋体"></span></span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">副组长：杨佩琼、冯王亮、朱水军、任联君、刘明玉、裘东</span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:宋体">成</span>  <span style="font-family:宋体">员：王月琴、马丹娜、祝智浩、孟德超、何隽豪、王佩金、王青、孙舒曼；高一各班班主任；医务（范国娟、魏杲）；</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px"></span></strong></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">四、时间安排：</span></strong><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:Calibri">2025</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">8</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">23</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日——</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">2025</span><span style="font-family:宋体">年</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">8</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">29</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日</span></span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">五、教官、班主任指导班级安排</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:宋体">本级高一新生共</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">19</span><span style="font-family:宋体">个班级，需</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">23</span><span style="font-family:宋体">位教官（</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">19+4</span><span style="font-family:宋体">）。教官于</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">8</span><span style="font-family:宋体">月</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">21</span><span style="font-family:宋体">日下午两点报到，明确落实训练场地及相关事项。</span></span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">备注</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">：</span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"> </span><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:宋体">①教官休息室，宿舍；②教官在学校教工食堂二楼用餐，早餐 </span><span style="font-family:Calibri">6:40</span><span style="font-family:宋体">，中餐 </span><span style="font-family:Calibri">11</span><span style="font-family:宋体">：</span><span style="font-family:Calibri">50</span><span style="font-family:宋体">，</span></span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12px;">晚餐</span><span style="font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri;">17</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12px;">：</span><span style="font-size: 12px; font-family: Calibri;">00</span><span style="font-family: 宋体; font-size: 12px;">。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 14px">六、措施要求</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">本次新生军训由德育处具体负责，学校有关部门应积极配合、支持。高一年管会、班主任等成员要坚持到场配合教官组织、督促学生认真参加军训，保证学生的安全，全体学生要遵守学校纪律，要求各班列队进出操场，发扬吃苦耐劳、团结向上的精神。军训期间要求服装统一。德育处将对本次军训的组织工作、训练情况、会操表现进行检查评比，对组织纪律性强、训练认真刻苦、会操表现突出的学生和班级进行表彰。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 12px">七、各项先进设奖</span></strong></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">1．军训积极分子：每连 10 人（不含校荐标兵）；</span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">2. 校军训标兵：每连1人；</span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">3．军训会操比赛，设一等奖 10 个、二等奖 9个；</span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">4. 寝室内务比赛优胜奖，男女寝室各 10 个；</span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">5.“合唱比赛 ”设一等奖 5个，二等奖7 个，三等奖7个；</span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">6. 军训先进连队（8 个）；</span></p><p style="text-indent:24px;text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><span style=";font-family:宋体;font-size:12px">7. 军训最佳连队。</span></p><p style="text-autospace:ideograph-numeric;line-height:35px"><strong><span style="font-family: 宋体;font-size: 19px">附：活动安排表</span></strong></p><table width="575" style="width: 551px;"><tbody><tr style="height:28px" class="firstRow"><td width="45" valign="center" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-style: solid;"><p style=";text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;font-size: 12px">日期</span></strong></p></td><td width="122" valign="center" colspan="2" style="padding: 0px 7px; border-width: 1px; border-style: solid; border-left-color: initial; border-right-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-top-color: rgb(0, 0, 0); border-bottom-color: rgb(0, 0, 0);"><p style=";text-align:center;vertical-align:middle"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋;f